Note on the bundled audio

The .mp3/.wav files under assets/clips/ are synthesized speech, generated with
Alibaba Cloud Bailian (Model Studio) text-to-speech. They are distributed under
the same MIT terms as the code above, as part of this package.

They are not a recording of any person's voice. If you plan to use them, check
that your own use is consistent with the terms of the service they were
generated with. Nothing here grants rights to the underlying voice model.

You do not have to use the bundled audio at all: scripts/build.mjs can generate
your own set, and the plugin prefers files you place in
$DSH_HOME/voice-alerts/clips/ over the packaged ones.
